problems.solution:
Matricele din teste sunt diagonal dominante, deci metoda converge.

```matlab
function [x, k] = jacobi(A, b, x0, tol, maxit)
    n = length(b);
    x = x0;
    for k = 1:maxit
        xn = x;
        for i = 1:n
            s = 0;
            for j = 1:n
                if j ~= i
                    s = s + A(i, j) * x(j);
                end
            end
            xn(i) = (b(i) - s) / A(i, i);
        end
        if norm(xn - x, Inf) < tol
            x = xn;
            return;
        end
        x = xn;
    end
end
```

